#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:172
msgid "\"Proton\" is falcond's general profile for any Proton game without a profile of its own: performance mode and screen-saver inhibit, no scheduler, no V-Cache preference. Create a profile in Profiles to choose more."
